  <item>
    <title>E26｜热爱是人生的必选项？NO！允许自己“不爱”宣言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6886fd56a12f9ff06a61cd7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6886fd56a12f9ff06a61cd7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Jul 2025 04:35:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>填同学录爱好栏？我直接写“无”</span></p><span></span><p><span>我写睡觉，半年骑一次单车算热爱吗？”（灵魂发问）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a>童年阴影大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>“别人特长钢琴跳舞，我特长——装追星！”（合群的演技派） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>“爱好？我连人都不怎么爱！人生像条咸鱼…”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a>颠覆三观时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>李娜竟然不爱网球！犹太人也不一定爱经商？…那我没爱好很正常嘛！ &nbsp;扶额苦笑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>羡慕刻骨铭心的爱情！但我连思想钢印都焊不牢！看恋人都像看傻逼…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a>毒鸡汤时间</span></p><span></span><p><span>想把爱好变工作？——朋友，你听过‘别把恋人变同事’吗？”（血泪警告）</span></p><span></span><p><span>逛街是爱好？干了商业后…我现在网购像逃命！”（PTSD了） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>玄学讨论：热爱靠运气？</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏伯渝70岁登珠峰——感动！但找这种人当老公？达咩！</span></p><span></span><p><span>鸡娃报班？我小时候连‘专业是啥’都不知道！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 终极和解宣言</span></p><span></span><p><span>充实又悠闲＝1/3工作+1/3玩+1/3躺着！这叫状态热爱！</span></p><span></span><p><span>没热爱？无所谓！我会用‘偶尔想干一下的事’糊弄人生！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a>结尾暴言</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱不上人，爱不上事，但我爱我自己——的懒惰！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：head empty-Tsunders Twintails</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/675bcade4b55c595fdcb10dd/lpIxz8hPsrIf3ZYI7bl8tSWaBSZb.m4a" length="49407005" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbAYxmd_S7MZr18LzLC9sJ0lQMl.jpg"/>
