  <item>
    <title>E25｜被野鸡比赛毒打的乐观初跑勇士！再野的比赛都能感受内啡肽</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687cd49fa12f9ff06a1667a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687cd49fa12f9ff06a1667a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Jul 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>今天没主题！说一下野比赛的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 野鸡赛事奇幻报名</span></p><span></span><p><span>迷惑操作</span></p><span></span><p><span>①天价报名费（对比正规半马120元）</span></p><span></span><p><span>②领物点在破酒店：2个纸箱+1张茶几=领物台</span></p><span></span><p><span>赛包开箱：矿泉水/拳头小蛋糕/丑到报警的M码参赛服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 赛场离谱实录</span></p><span></span><p><span>观众阵容：保洁阿姨+散养大公鸡（咕咕队疯狂打call）</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影师的劫：老公借大炮镜头反被官方"招安"</span></p><span></span><p><span>社死瞬间：看到镜头突然加速→人脸识别系统崩溃</span></p><span></span><p><span>补给站奇观：两阿姨倒水三人排队（效率堪比树懒）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 冲线惨案现场</span></p><span></span><p><span>老公摔出灵魂镜头：为拍冲线平地躺尸草坪</span></p><span></span><p><span>被迫二刷终点线：笑出后槽牙摆拍冲刺</span></p><span></span><p><span>完赛福利：奖牌+号码布打勾（香蕉？不存在的！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 人类运动迷惑行为大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>自信大姐：1公里走路的"六公里冠军候选人"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>野赛体验像开盲盒，笑出腹肌比练出腹肌</span></p><span></span><p><span>内啡肽的快乐，是后槽牙笑飞也值得！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：head empty-Tsunders Twintails</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/675bcade4b55c595fdcb10dd/li-KJQMBBMfDJ2emXaH-zQfNKqib.m4a" length="56063616" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbAYxmd_S7MZr18LzLC9sJ0lQMl.jpg"/>
