  <item>
    <title>E24｜我需要社交空调：如何在热情似火和冷若冰霜中找寻合适的恒温</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686a59c660f8f77d401921e9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686a59c660f8f77d401921e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>可达鸭安利史上最写实爱情片：《恋爱的温度》（aka《银行狗的分手循环纪录片》） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>片名太劝退？不！是导演预判了人类社交体温失调的未来！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 绝对零度领域</span></p><span></span><p><span>社交温度计显示：-10℃**（自曝比及格线还低5℃） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>雷区蹦迪指南： &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;问"在干嘛"=安装隐形监控（建议直接报警） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;每天聊天=慢性谋杀（呼吸权警告⚠️） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>对象查岗=启动自爆程序（"关你屁事"语音已就位） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 震惊！最长冷战记录：和摩羯座恋爱月抛式联系（和平鸽瞳孔地震："这™叫谈恋爱？？"） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 和平哥の烈焰焚情时间</span></p><span></span><p><span>反方辩友拍桌怒吼："一个月不联系？默认丧偶服务了解下！" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲情温度拉锯战： &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>母上大人催婚技："周末带'那个谁'回家"→瞬间冻僵 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>"每月4个周末，分你1次已是割地赔款！"</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 人类迷惑行为大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>作死行为TOP3：</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 擅闯卧室翻东西=领取5米大刀体验券 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 追问"为啥拒绝邀约"=触发i人毁灭模式 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 强行接送晚班=加班式恋爱（"我车技差的老公让我多加班20分钟！"） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 跨服聊天急救室&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>当代社交悖论： &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>"聊日常=培养感情"&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>"聊日常=消耗我珍贵的生命电量" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>宇宙级解决方案： &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;情侣住同小区不同单元</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友查户口？反手甩出："你为什么好奇！" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a> 猝不及防END</span></p><span></span><p><span>"在座的低温星人！让我看到你们的双手！"</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：head empty-Tsunders Twintails</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/675bcade4b55c595fdcb10dd/li4Ha0wIUmr4o6m8g2MROjUAK0II.m4a" length="63920154" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbAYxmd_S7MZr18LzLC9sJ0lQMl.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E23｜谁还没有点小矛盾在身上：感性又理性、社恐又怕冷场、一边养生一边盼望陨石来袭...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685fa8e6bef90978ec52e885</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685fa8e6bef90978ec52e885</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 人类起源之谜</span></p><span></span><p><span>暴论：人类应该不是地球原住民（证据：动物都是表里如一） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 肉体VS灵魂分裂现场</span></p><span></span><p><span>和平鸽的肉体=博物馆木乃伊，精神=蹦迪选手 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>人类迷惑行为：约我出门像登月，出门后嗨成猴 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 社交牛杂症晚期</span></p><span></span><p><span>I人的崩溃：怕冷场怕到主动暖场，暖完骂自己犯贱 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>心理出门要准备三年，实际只换了条睡裤！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 亲情爱情双标现场&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;回家前：编100个借口不挪屁股 ；离家时：偷偷抹两滴鳄鱼泪 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 又敏感又没有共情力</span></p><span></span><p><span>看流浪狗视频哭湿枕头 ，听朋友诉苦内心OS“关我屁事” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">45:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 毁灭地球VS养生续命</span></p><span></span><p><span>日常发疯：盼小行星撞地球</span></p><span></span><p><span>养生玄学：又不怕死又爱养生vs又怕死又摆烂</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3301">55:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 人类矛盾行为大和解</span></p><span></span><p><span>“选舒服的姿势当精分，是当代人最后的温柔” &nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/675bcade4b55c595fdcb10dd/lqj19KEcf3FRAeO9usMRQ3cPd_xf.m4a" length="57950851" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbAYxmd_S7MZr18LzLC9sJ0lQMl.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E22｜人无语的时候真的会笑！那些年我们哭笑不得的无语瞬间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6857bee34abe6e29cb5f523c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6857bee34abe6e29cb5f523c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Jun 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 开场即翻车</span></p><span></span><p><span>"要死不活"的和平鸽开场，录音崩了3次——因为耳机根本没连！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>选题有毒（中年危机变无语瞬间），甩锅玄学。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 法庭迷惑行为大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>被告申请原告律师回避：理由竟是"原告和律师有微信群"❓ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>法官憋笑失败实录："你们背地里蛐蛐我？" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 执行现场秒变赌咒擂台</span></p><span></span><p><span>当事人激情发誓："我说假话明天被车撞！" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>法院拜佛哥：楼梯间双手合十求胜诉，法官："出去拜！" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1206">20:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1719">28:39</a> 良好市民社死名场面</span></p><span></span><p><span>火灾现场举爪发言："我有视频！"——结果群名暴露《XX地最徒有美貌的女子》 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>消防员："删了，你传播舆情！"（但邻居群已传遍） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>抱狗逃生穿省服（珊瑚绒大棉袄），荣获"最佳市民"称号 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a> 职场的降智打击</span></p><span></span><p><span>银行冥币刺客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>菜鸟柜员："这假币颜色好鲜亮！" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>同事："这是玉皇大帝汇款专用币" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>老板头发晴雨表：</span></p><span></span><p><span>老板玩头发=即将暴怒（述职现场：PPT第1页就开始编辫子！） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>厕所遇领导哲学 &nbsp;：</span></p><span></span><p><span>"好巧啊您也来放水？"——人类最尴尬寒暄没有之一 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137744">38:15:44</a>:59 领导克我玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span>停车场和店长顶牛："傻逼让不让？"摇窗发现是领导…火速装死 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>楼梯间喊行长"哥"——从此全行追债都找"咱哥" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>下班忘关电脑被罚写检讨："我愧对祖国电费" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">52:29</a> 人类迷惑行为总结</span></p><span></span><p><span>"当事人别来法庭！否则TVB看多会起立'尊敬的审判长！'" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>"选题再录玄学我就举5米大刀——但先检查耳机连没连。" &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 戛然而止的结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期主题：《吉祥话保命指南》——再翻车就改行卖搓澡球！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：head empty-Tsunders Twintails</span></p>]]></description>
