    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 开场暴击</span></p><span></span><p><span>人类迷惑观察：年龄越大分享欲越低，00后甚至20岁就开始“闭麦” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 朋友圈修罗场</span></p><span></span><p><span>分组地狱：好友分组到崩溃→“宁愿去世也不分组！” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>人设崩塌：朋友圈变职场秀场→律师开庭照VS普通人吐槽欲 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>大型社死：醉酒发圈次日悔恨→“两耳发烫想钻地洞！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 面对面沉默之谜</span></p><span></span><p><span>手机防御结界：一人拿手机=全员加载信息 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃瓜经济学：3-4人局才敢聊馊瓜→“正反馈是瓜田永动机！” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>哑巴伴侣困境：老公变室友？户外徒步竟成深度聊天唯一场景 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 社交媒体摆烂实录</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博坟场：用真名发帖吓到改名→“前任的现任别视奸我！” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书树洞：熟人免进区→“毫无心理顾虑” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>点赞潜规则：同事被迫营业点赞→“律所老板发圈竟无人问津” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 复活分享欲野路子</span></p><span></span><p><span>酒精催化剂：微醺分享欲暴涨→但需提前注射“别发朋友圈”疫苗 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>大自然疗法：爬山徒步让哑巴开口→“树比老公懂倾听！” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃瓜组局指南：馊瓜冷饭回锅炒→“表情+语调=新鲜瓜2.0” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 暴言收尾 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>成年人社交真相：“不是分享欲消失，是听众配不上我的情绪！” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>终极自救方案：降低预期→哑巴偶尔说话算惊喜 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：head empty-Tsunders Twintails</span></p>]]></description>
