  <item>
    <title>16E｜人与人之前的审美差异大过物种多样性！不会所有人都喜欢你，但也自有冤种把你捧在手心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680deda48aed253fa3ca6d37</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680deda48aed253fa3ca6d37</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Apr 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>53分钟人类多样性观察实录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> - 开场暴击</span></p><span></span><p><span>人与人之间的审美差异大过物种多样性，我偏爱肌肉男女，你却怕他们旺盛的生命力灼烧到你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> - 人类审美迷惑行为大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> - 人类进化史之审美变异篇</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾经沉迷"白瘦幼"女明星 → 现在为小麦色腹肌运动博主哐哐撞大墙</span></p><span></span><p><span>"他穿老头汗衫开演唱会的样子，像极了爱情！"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a> - 当代焦虑制造机的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书魔法攻击："刷10分钟觉得自己是垃圾，刷30分钟直接想投胎"</span></p><span></span><p><span>化妆量子纠缠："不涂高光会死星人vs素颜睡衣战神的世纪对决"</span></p><span></span><p><span>"身高矮焦虑？不存在的！但臀围少1cm我能哭三天"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> - 人类身体部位歧视现场</span></p><span></span><p><span>可达鸭的臀部执念："看人先看臀，穿泳装少块肉等于人生失败"</span></p><span></span><p><span>和平鸽的反杀："你盯着别人屁股看的样子，像极了地铁变态"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> - 医美的哲学辩论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2418">40:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2929">48:49</a> - 恋爱脑的降维打击</span></p><span></span><p><span>土象心动暴击："他猜中我的美甲手！这就是爱情！"</span></p><span></span><p><span>火象恋爱脑："把对象丑照当萌点，你怕不是开了佛光滤镜？"</span></p><span></span><p><span>双方互相认证："建议你俩组合出道《人类迷惑爱情行为大赏》"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> - 终极大和解</span></p><span></span><p><span>"喜欢你的人，连你三天没洗的头都能写成散文诗"</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>head empty-Tsunders Twintails</span></p>]]></description>
