  <item>
    <title>E15｜人甚至无法共情以前的自己，这是一期羞耻合集</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6803a3941f1db84a564e9aa6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6803a3941f1db84a564e9aa6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>- 「看到初中生天台激吻，我DNA动了——当年我也这么野吗？」 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>渣男拿我立深情人设，我竟然还以为自己是白月光</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 初恋骚操作：分手后QQ空间建「前女友自拍博物馆」，深情语录：「都是误会！」 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>无法理解的迷之假粉丝行为，给各位爱过的老师们道歉</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 五月天演唱会门票必须买最贵的，但荧光棒必须是义乌的</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 超女时期：假装喜欢笔笔，转头混进李宇春粉丝会</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 何洁冲我笑了一下，我连夜把叶一茜踢出QQ空间！」&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>90后的行为艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 李宇春同款爆炸头：学霸午休逃课找Tony，下午顶「扫把」进教室。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 篮球赛备战：「头发不炸，怎么carry全场？」 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 大头贴考古：「这发型是牛顿的万有引力？」 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>怪就怪电视剧误导我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小李飞刀》名场面：「你来的正是时候！」（三人拥抱，弹幕：这是可以播的吗？） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">45:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>氪金追星的羞耻巅峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 为爱豆买奶投票：朋友生日收到「酸奶+二维码」，附赠留言：「喝不完就浇花！」 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 微博取关仪式：「删博如炸粪坑，崩一身还要装路过。」 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3301">55:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a>结尾</span></p>]]></description>
