  <item>
    <title>E14｜成长是你学会允许鳞片脱落，把旧我留在海底</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fb657f623bc78c394c1c9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fb657f623bc78c394c1c9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 开场：从“白日梦想家”到现实感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 拖延已久的成长话题，因一次偶遇触发思考。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 问题抛出：“你是在哪个瞬间突然觉得自己长大了？” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 第一课：与很多人，已见过此生最后一面&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 小区偶遇前任哥：8年未见的熟人，不刻意联系即是永别。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 亲情计算题：母亲一句“我们还能见多少面”带来的冲击。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 当见面频率开始按年计算，每一面都可能是最后一面。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 职场与友情：背叛、释怀与成年人的伪装</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 职场“被刺”故事：信任的姐妹挖走团队核心成员，崩溃与成长。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 友情渐行渐远：大学好友结婚未通知，距离如何稀释亲密感。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 人与人的关系，不是刻意不见才会消失。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 亲情真相：爱是纯粹，还是利益捆绑？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 父母催婚背后的矛盾：面子、养老焦虑与“不纯粹的爱”。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 父亲生日照片：凶悍老爸变慈祥小老头，亲情滤镜下的温柔。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 所有感情都有所图，但爱依然值得珍惜。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 快乐守恒定律：越长大越难，越简单越真&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 快乐对比：从前激烈鲜活，如今平淡却深刻。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 治愈小事：遛狗被夸、野花拍照、中年人的“蜡笔小新式伪装”。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 快乐的阈值变高，但细微幸福的感知力更强了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2881">48:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a> 成长十课：你修到第几章？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 网易云热评“人生十课”拆解：从爱己到独行。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 可达鸭自评：“前五课勉强及格，独行仍需练习。” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 坦然接受任何人的离开，或许是成年第一课。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3511">58:31</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a> 结尾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 陈楚生《行走的鱼》——“写尽成长的笨拙与自洽”。 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 结语：“长大或许不快乐，但请允许自己偶尔肤浅，永远鲜活。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>彩蛋：最后附上小狗带花照，希望大家也能感知细微幸福 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnua4f1lQ309kO-5YrOPpuhA-mhJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>sacred playsecret place</span></p><span></span><p><span>行走的鱼-陈楚生、李玖哲、宝石gem</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/675bcade4b55c595fdcb10dd/lt-mLxgKMHFY16DN6SPu4lQSMTRM.m4a" length="63920357" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbAYxmd_S7MZr18LzLC9sJ0lQMl.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E13｜婚姻消亡史？透视现代人的爱与困局</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f4b5300decaeb094a052a8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f4b5300decaeb094a052a8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Apr 2025 07:11:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>首先给大家道歉，本期录制的时候由于可达鸭麦带反了，导致音频听感有点塑料～下次一定～～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span>和平鸽（拉子）、可达鸭（已婚）</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国结婚率9年连降，离婚率15年暴涨3.8倍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 婚姻的本质是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>社会契约 vs 爱情结晶：婚姻是制度工具还是情感绑定？</span></p><span></span><p><span>反人性？爱情与责任的冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 代际鸿沟：老一辈的“帮手论”</span></p><span></span><p><span>父母催婚逻辑：“上坟需要帮手”“电器坏了有人修”</span></p><span></span><p><span>商品化婚姻：相亲市场的“配料表式”匹配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 婚姻中的利益与风险</span></p><span></span><p><span>法律视角：财产转移、离婚冷静期、连带责任</span></p><span></span><p><span>风险共担还是互相算计？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 年轻人为什么不婚？</span></p><span></span><p><span>经济压力：房贷、育儿成本、生活质量下降</span></p><span></span><p><span>自我意识觉醒：拒绝“将就”，重视个体幸福感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 职场与婚姻的冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span>女性困境：已婚未育的职场歧视</span></p><span></span><p><span>996下的精力分配：谁还有空经营婚姻？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 生育观巨变</span></p><span></span><p><span>从“加双筷子”到“精英教育”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“不生是贡献”：悲观预期与责任焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 同性婚姻的困境</span></p><span></span><p><span>法律空白：房产共有代替结婚证？</span></p><span></span><p><span>理想关系：自由恋爱无需绑定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 婚姻制度的未来设想</span></p><span></span><p><span>合同制婚姻：到期续约，灵活调整</span></p><span></span><p><span>网友锐评：“离婚冷静期劝退结婚率”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 幽默彩蛋：婚礼幻想与翻车现场</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我的婚礼你绝对笑场！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“CP结婚我爆哭，行婚对视必破功”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>核心观点：婚姻是选择，不是义务</span></p><span></span><p><span>听众寄语：“知道自己要什么，比盲目入场更重要”</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>head empty-Tsunders Twintails</span></p>]]></description>
